Troubleshooting Tips
Issue: Script shows "Permission denied"

Solution: Ensure script is executable with chmod +x monitor_daemon.py
Issue: "File not found" error

Solution: Verify you're in the correct directory (~/monitoring-lab)
Check log file exists: ls logs/access.log
Issue: No alerts generated

Solution: Check the alert conditions in check_alert_conditions() function
Verify output directory exists: mkdir -p output
Issue: Daemon won't stop

Solution: Find process ID with ps aux | grep monitor_daemon.py
Kill process: kill -9 <PID>
